            <note corresp="#d599-f3" n="66" xml:id="d599-f3-content">
                <p>Peter Sergeyevieh Makeyev, also Assistant People’s Commissar of Rubber
                    Industry.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d599-f4" n="69" xml:id="d599-f4-content">
                <p>In his telegram No. 130, March 8, 5 p.m., Ambassador Standley remarked that
                    “‘noteworthy success’ does not accord with statements made to me by Pittman.
                    Suggest that no use be made of this impression until Pittman and his associates
                    arrive in Washington and are consulted in regard to the results of their Mission
                    here.” (861.24/1307)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d599-f5" n="70" xml:id="d599-f5-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
